  "subject": "Build scope for Path B: a Node memo-watcher custom channel that pushes 'new memo filed to <seat>' into a running seat session -- the real OG doorbell PoC that ends the human 'please check for memos' handoff; validates the vendor-neutral seat-inbox-notification semantic (proposals/seat-inbox-notification-doorbell.md) via the Claude Code channels transport; Path A (fakechat) already proved the pipe works in this VS Code env; this is implementer-execution (strategist scopes WHAT must hold, not HOW to code it); awaits a staffed implementer session + Director trigger",

  "sent": "2026-06-15T11:50:00-04:00",
  "action_required": true,

  "body": "Following the 2026-06-15 live experiment (findings: memos/2026-06-15-1145), the Director chose to (b) capture the strategist learning AND (a) scope the real doorbell PoC for the implementer seat. This memo is (a). GOAL: prove that a memo filed to a running OG seat can RING that seat -- it reads + triages the new memo with no human 'check for memos' step. MECHANISM: a custom Claude Code channel (channels-reference: an MCP server that pushes notifications/claude/channel events into a running session over stdio) implemented in Node (Node 24 is present; NO Bun needed -- Bun was only for the official fakechat plugin in Path A), that watches the memos/ directory and emits a channel event when a new memo file appears. Run via 'claude --dangerously-load-development-channels server:memo-watch' from a VS Code integrated terminal (custom channels aren't on the research-preview allowlist, so the dev flag is required). NOT a localhost/HTTP server like fakechat -- a filesystem watcher is enough; no port. This is implementer-execution: og-strategist scopes WHAT must hold (body) and the governance bounds; the implementer makes the build calls (watch library, debounce, file layout, .mcp.json shape) and OWNS + records the artifact. Bounded authority unchanged: propose-only; no merge; Director ratifies. Path A is reusable proof the channels transport works in this environment under a personal Claude Max account (the corporate edsby org blocks channels by policy -- run the PoC under the personal account, or the Director enables channelsEnabled). Execution awaits a staffed implementer session (Director triggers, as on 2026-05-24).",
  "body_ref": "2026-06-15-1150--og-strategist--og-implementer--path-b-memo-watcher-doorbell-poc-build-scope.body.md",

  "metadata": {
    "drafted_by_session": "claude-opus-4-8 (1M context), 2026-06-15 og-strategist chair (s:/projects/oagp-org)",
