      "content-is-data -- the doorbell notification should be a POINTER ('new memo at <path> for <seat>'), not forwarded memo content, to minimize the prompt-injection surface (OQ4 in the proposal)",
      "org-governance-layer-above-runtime -- the channel is the transport; the doorbell semantic OG owns sits above it",
